{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind the Clown is a short (less than an hour long) stealth horror game that lets you explore a cursed circus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Take on the role of Mike, a lonely child who has suffered a tragic accident. Now in critical condition, your thoughts fixate on a single dream: a visit to the circus. As your life hangs by a thread, a demonic entity grants your final wish. <br> <br>Your memories are fusing with a cursed circus, twisting into your worst nightmare. A sinister presence lurks in the shadows, demanding your soul. You must burn the scattered circus posters to lift the curse and escape... before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/967a60782eb8ef61c1df62270980a93d.poster.avif?t=1768607829\" width=780 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/967a60782eb8ef61c1df62270980a93d.webm?t=1768607829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-present killer clown that can hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth gameplay focused on sneaking, hiding, and escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeform exploration. The\u00a0eerie circus is an open area to discover as you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings. Immerse yourself in a dramatic story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling. Discover bits of a bigger plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic circus music and sfxs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated cutscenes.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BURNING DESIRE","path":"https://